# This repo is PUBLIC, and remote_config.json is fetched by every installed copy
# of Forge Master Companion. Allowlist, not blocklist: anything not named below is
# ignored, so a stray file (app source, a keystore, a build) cannot be committed
# here by accident. To add a new kind of file, add a "!" line for it on purpose.
*
!.gitignore
!*.md
!remote_config.json
!Version Control
!.github/
!.github/**
